{"id":"u-83c87171-50a7-4f96-b934-beaeb9418bdf","src":"community","title":"Fck! What a Transformation! Phase 1","author":"Suraj S.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/f2rW38-fck-what-a-transformation","desc":"Phase 1 - 14 week training and cardio program to help you get in the best shape of your freaking life. Simple program but not easy. Trust the process and this will change you.\n\n1. Cardio days are not optional. Sorry. You have to do this.\n2. Eat in a 300 cal deficit for 14 weeks. Weigh yourself daily, focus on average weekly weight.\n3. Week 15 will be a diet break where you will eat at maintenance. Train the same.\n4. Phase 2 and 3 will be added as separate programs. Stay tuned for that. \n\nExercises are selected which would give you the most bang for your buck. You can't look or train like Cbum as a natty, however you can work towards the physique proportions. That is exactly what this program focuses on.  Putting muscles in the right areas for that drooling classic physique. \n\nSupplements- If you have a diet which helps you with 0.8-1 gram of pound of bodyweight protein, gets you all the required micro nutrients then you don't need any Supplements.  If not, Creatine, Vit D+K2, Fish oil omega 3, Zinc are the best bets. You can also take magnesium at night for better sleep. Vegan, vegetarian,  non vegetarian all diets goes the same if the requirements are full filled.\n\nTrain Mon,Tue,Thu, fri & Sat- Walk on rest days,you don't need to sit at home for rest. Get out in the morning sun, and visualize your end goal. You are ready to peak! Let's get this 14 week done. See you in Phase 2.","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":17,"rate":5,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-11-03T16:14:03.151Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper body","Lower Body","Upper Body Push","Upper body Pull focus","Legs + arm pump"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"